        "Memoir"
      ],
      "description": "Sebeez, a book by Alemayehu Wassie Eshete Translated by Yonas Tesfaye Woldetsadik. Dear Readers, This work, Sebeez, stands apart from my previous writings in both its content and structure. While my earlier books—already made available to the public—focused on specific themes with a clear beginning and end, Sebeez is different. It is a collection of real-life experiences gathered across different times and places throughout my life. \" Addis Books!",
