      ],
      "description": "Not a Cinderella Story, a book by Bethel Stevens . Not a Cinderella Story is a raw, deeply moving memoir that takes readers on an emotional journey through the life-altering experience of love, unexpected loss, and the quest to regain faith and find healing. It is a story of how a vibrant young woman found herself living a love story straight out of a fairy tale, only to face the unimaginable when her husband becomes ill and passes away, leaving her to navigate the harsh realities of widowhood at a young age.",
